Alpine Linux 3.24 (armv7) on RK3229 / MX10 -- notes
===================================================

Boot chain
  BootROM -> idblock (DDR init + miniloader, in eMMC) -> uboot partition
  (mainline U-Boot, eMMC) -> USB stick: /extlinux/extlinux.conf on p1
  -> zImage + rk3229-mx10.dtb -> root=PARTUUID=52334b32-02 (p2, ext4).

This rootfs is the stock Alpine "minirootfs" plus a small BusyBox-init setup
(/etc/inittab, /etc/rk3229/rc.sysinit).  OpenRC is not installed:

  apk update
  apk add openrc openssh e2fsprogs-extra     # optional

Growing the root filesystem to the whole stick (from a PC is easiest):
  growpart /dev/sdX 2 && e2fsck -f /dev/sdX2 && resize2fs /dev/sdX2

Update U-Boot in eMMC from Linux (DANGEROUS -- keep the maskrom recovery
procedure at hand):
  dd if=/boot/rk3229/uboot.img of=/dev/mmcblk2 bs=512 seek=8192 conv=fsync
